= Abstract

Hypertension is very common. We tested a novel drug in a randomised trial. 120 patients were enrolled. The data was analysed with ANOVA and the effect was significant @smith2020. Blood pressure fell 12mmHg (p=0.000).

= Introduction

Prior work proves that zetaprol works in order to lower pressure. It is groundbreaking. See the figure below.

= Methods

Patients were recruited in 2023. Doses were 5mg or 10mg given at 37 degrees C. We utilize SPSS for analysis. Ages of 18-65 years were allowed.

$ Delta p = p_1 - p_0 $

